==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The most complex part of this stage is the constant spam of zombie peons along with the infinite Zir Zeals that appear after 1 minute, which also have an absurdly long digging range.

The first thing you have to do is deploy [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] or any fast unit to force the first zombies to dig, then annihilate them with [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cats]] protected by meat shields. After that, try to defeat the first One Horn before the first Zir Zeal digs ([[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] can help with that), so that once it comes out of its burrow, you have enough money to deploy ranged attack units like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] along with [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]]. Finally, let some of your units go forward so that when the Zir Zeals dig, they don't appear too close to the base.

As always, any [[Zombie Killer]] is welcome.

